{"desc": "This Button was posted by Yaya12085. Tagged with: button, hover effect, click effect, bookmark, dark, rounded, button, black, icon, purple, minimal, pin.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/c42cc849e0a11b79a637.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<button class=\"pinBtn\">\n  <span class=\"IconContainer\">\n    <svg\n      stroke-width=\"0\"\n      height=\"0.9rem><g id=\"\n      style=\"fill-rule:evenodd;clip-rule:evenodd;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-miterlimit:2;\"\n      xml:space=\"preserve\"\n      xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\n      xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n      version=\"1.1\"\n      viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"\n      fill=\"#000000\"\n    >\n      <g\n        stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n        stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n        id=\"SVGRepo_tracerCarrier\"\n      ></g>\n      <g id=\"SVGRepo_iconCarrier\">\n        <rect\n          style=\"fill:none;\"\n          height=\"800\"\n          width=\"1280\"\n          y=\"-320\"\n          x=\"-320\"\n          id=\"Icons\"\n        ></rect>\n        <g id=\"Icons1\">\n          <g id=\"Strike\"></g>\n          <g id=\"H1\"></g>\n          <g id=\"H2\"></g>\n          <g id=\"H3\"></g>\n          <g id=\"list-ul\"></g>\n          <g id=\"hamburger-1\"></g>\n          <g id=\"hamburger-2\"></g>\n          <g id=\"list-ol\"></g>\n          <g id=\"list-task\"></g>\n          <g id=\"trash\"></g>\n          <g id=\"vertical-menu\"></g>\n          <g id=\"horizontal-menu\"></g>\n          <g id=\"sidebar-2\"></g>\n          <g id=\"Pen\"></g>\n          <g id=\"Pen1\"></g>\n          <g id=\"clock\"></g>\n          <g id=\"external-link\"></g>\n          <g id=\"hr\"></g>\n          <g id=\"info\"></g>\n          <g id=\"warning\"></g>\n          <g id=\"plus-circle\"></g>\n          <g id=\"minus-circle\"></g>\n          <g id=\"vue\"></g>\n          <g id=\"cog\"></g>\n          <g id=\"logo\"></g>\n          <g id=\"radio-check\"></g>\n          <g id=\"eye-slash\"></g>\n          